  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ESMAP Energifond WB 2011-13</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ESMAP Energy Trust Fund WB 2011-13 - ESMAP Trust Fund WB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 The Energy Sector Management Assistance Programme (ESMAP) &#xe4;r ett    globalt program som sk&#xf6;ts av V&#xe4;rldsbanken sedan 1983. ESMAP&#xb4;s roll &#xe4;r att verka f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar energi och d&#xe4;rigenom minska fattigdom och       &#xe5;stadkomma ekonomisk tillv&#xe4;xt. Drygt 10 givare bidrartill en fond.    M&#xe5;lgrupp DAC-l&#xe4;nder www.esmap.org                                      Tidigare fas: 71500225</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Energy Sector Management Assistance Programme (ESMAP) is a global technical assistance partnership administerd by the WB since 1983.    ESMAP&#xb4;s mission is to promote the role of energy in poverty reduction and economic growth. More than 10 countries contribute to a multi     donor trust fund and support can be given to OECD DAC   www.esmap.org  Previous phase: 71500225</narrative>
  </description>
